SUMMARY:Big Break Showcase 2026
DESCRIPTION:Coffee Stain Publishing will host Big Break Showcase\, a new digital showcase designed to give unpublished and emerging developers the spotlight. It will air on September 29 at 10:00 a.m. PT / 1:00 p.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube. \nThe broadcast will feature “big new announcements” from Deep Rock Galactic\, Goat Simulator\, Lightyear Frontier\, Satisfactory\, Teardown\, as well as new independent game reveals\, news\, and updates from other independent publishers. \nConfirmed games and companies include: \nCoffee Stain Publishing\nGoat Simulator 3 (Coffee Stain North) – “An exciting reveal”Lightyear Frontier (Framebreak) – Version 1.0 release date announcementSatisfactory (Coffee Stain Studios) – “Big news”Plus further updates from across the label\nGhost Ship Publishing\nAnnouncement of new title developed by Guidelight GamesDeep Rock Galactic – “News from across the Deep Rock Galactic universe and beyond”Dinolords (Northplay) – New revealFLASK (Chop Chop Games) – Release date announcement and demo relaunch\nIndependent Publishers and Developers\nAurora ArtsDouble MooseFeeble MindsGloomKeyStudiosGripjawHypetrain DigitalJonathan SmårsKeepsakeKinetic PublishingLiving WorldsPerfect RandomPerfect potion GamesPugstormRaw FuryRegular MissileRescue PartySebastian Larsson and Andrea HartySolid Block of PowerSpeldosa InteractiveSplendid FailluresStunlock Studios
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/big-break-showcase-2026
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Event_Big-Break_09-29-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
