SUMMARY:The Triple-i Initiative: October 8\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:Evil Empire will host a surprise edition of The Triple-i Initiative on October 8 at 9:00 a.m. PT / 12:00 p.m. ET\, the company announced. You will be able to watch it on YouTube and Twitch. \nThe broadcast will feature 45 minutes of back-to-back trailers for independent games\, with eight exclusive world premieres from studios such as Amanita Design\, Norsfell\, Strange Scaffold\, and Team17\, plus gameplay reveals\, release dates\, and other announcements across 40 games\, including the new Among Us title\, Brotato\, Chained Together\, DAVE THE DIVER\, Haunted Paws\, Hela: of Mice & Magic\, MILITSIONER\, Outward 2\, Pony Island 2: Panda Circus\, Risk of Rain 2\, and Windrose.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/the-triple-i-initiative-october-8-2026
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Event_Triple-i_10-08-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
